msgid "System default output"
msgstr "Salida predeterminada del sistema"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6000
msgid "All local outputs, in sync"
msgstr "Todas las salidas locales, sincronizadas"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6049
msgid "Plays on every connected speaker at the same time — wired outputs are delayed to stay in step with Bluetooth."
msgstr "Reproduce en todos los altavoces conectados a la vez — las salidas con cable se retrasan para mantenerse al compás del Bluetooth."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6063
msgid "Keep it in tune by itself"
msgstr "Mantenerlo afinado solo"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6080
msgid "Listens now and then while music plays and puts the speakers back in step on its own. Nothing is audible and the music is never interrupted — if it ever cannot fix the drift on its own, it says so and leaves the measuring to you."
msgstr "Escucha de vez en cuando mientras suena la música y vuelve a poner los altavoces a la par por sí solo. No se oye nada y la música nunca se interrumpe — si alguna vez no puede corregir el desajuste por su cuenta, lo dice y te deja la medición a ti."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6096
#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6113
msgid "Sync fine-tune"
msgstr "Ajuste fino de sincronía"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6106
msgid "How far behind the Bluetooth speaker runs — the other outputs are held back by this much to match it. The automatic check below reports something else: how far apart they still land."
msgstr "Cuánto se retrasa el altavoz Bluetooth: las demás salidas se retienen otro tanto para igualarlo. La comprobación automática de abajo informa de otra cosa: cuánta diferencia queda todavía."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6145
msgid "If the Bluetooth speaker still trails the wired ones, raise this until they play together."
msgstr "Si el altavoz Bluetooth aún va detrás de los cableados, sube esto hasta que suenen juntos."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6157
msgid "Sync delay in milliseconds"
msgstr "Retardo de sincronización en milisegundos"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6179
msgid "Type an exact delay in milliseconds — the slider moves in steps of ten."
msgstr "Escribe un retardo exacto en milisegundos — el deslizador se mueve en pasos de diez."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6183
msgid "ms"
msgstr "ms"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6198
msgid "Calibrate with the microphone"
msgstr "Calibrar con el micrófono"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6210
msgid "Measures with a tone too high to hear how far the Bluetooth speaker trails, and sets the delay automatically. Speaker balance is left as it is — matching loudness needs a sound you would hear."
msgstr "Mide con un tono demasiado agudo para oírlo cuánto se retrasa el altavoz Bluetooth y ajusta el retardo automáticamente. El balance se deja como está: igualar volúmenes necesita un sonido audible."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6211
msgid "Plays a few loud clicks through each speaker and measures with the microphone how far the Bluetooth speaker trails — the delay is set automatically."
msgstr "Reproduce unos clics fuertes por cada altavoz y mide con el micrófono cuánto se retrasa el altavoz Bluetooth — el retardo se ajusta automáticamente."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6224
msgid "Calibration needs a Bluetooth speaker in the group — connect one and the button wakes up."
msgstr "La calibración necesita un altavoz Bluetooth en el grupo: conecta uno y el botón despierta."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6253
msgid "Plays a short tone too high to hear through each speaker every few minutes and re-checks the sync when they drift apart. Audio is processed on this computer only — never stored, never sent anywhere."
msgstr "Reproduce cada pocos minutos un tono demasiado agudo para oírlo por cada altavoz y vuelve a comprobar la sincronización cuando se desajustan. El audio se procesa solo en este equipo: nunca se guarda ni se envía a ninguna parte."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6294
msgid "Tuned automatically — %1"
msgstr "Ajustado automáticamente — %1"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6319
msgid "Set the delay by ear (no microphone)"
msgstr "Ajustar el retardo de oído (sin micrófono)"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6322
msgid "Hides the microphone measurement and the automatic checks, and never listens to the room. Use the fine-tune slider above until the speakers sound together."
msgstr "Oculta la medición con micrófono y las comprobaciones automáticas, y nunca escucha la sala. Usa el control de ajuste fino de arriba hasta que los altavoces suenen juntos."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6338
msgid "Measure with a tone too high to hear"
msgstr "Medir con un tono demasiado agudo para oírlo"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6341
msgid "Measures with an 18–19 kHz sweep, which most adults cannot hear and music does not reach, so the room can stay noisy. Younger ears often can hear it, and dogs and cats certainly do — turn it off and measurement uses a short audible click instead, which needs a quiet room."
msgstr "Mide con un barrido de 18–19 kHz que la mayoría de los adultos no oye y al que la música no llega, así que la sala puede seguir con ruido. Los oídos jóvenes suelen oírlo, y los perros y los gatos sin duda. Si lo desactivas, la medición usa un clic audible corto que necesita una sala en silencio."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6370
msgid "%1 is remembered for the sync — connect it and it rejoins automatically."
msgstr "%1 está recordado para la sincronización: conéctelo y se reincorporará automáticamente."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6395
msgid "Round 1 of 2 — clicks through every speaker…"
msgstr "Ronda 1 de 2 — clics por cada altavoz…"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6396
msgid "Round 2 of 2 — quiet, checking the result…"
msgstr "Ronda 2 de 2 — silencio, comprobando el resultado…"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6418
msgid "Stops the measurement, unmutes every speaker and gives the music back."
msgstr "Detiene la medición, quita el silencio a todos los altavoces y devuelve la música."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6447
msgid "%1 plays in the group"
msgstr "%1 suena en el grupo"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6460
msgid "Whether this speaker plays in the group — untick to leave it out without disconnecting it. Remembered for the device."
msgstr "Si este altavoz suena en el grupo — desmárcalo para dejarlo fuera sin desconectarlo. Se recuerda para el dispositivo."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6469
msgid "%1 (nothing plugged in)"
msgstr "%1 (nada conectado)"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6483
msgid "Balance of %1"
msgstr "Balance de %1"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6492
msgid "This speaker's share of the volume — the balance follows every master move and is remembered for the device. It scales only what this widget plays; the per-device volume in the system's audio settings is a separate, untouched layer — which is why those numbers differ from these sliders."
msgstr "La parte de este altavoz en el volumen: el balance sigue cada movimiento del control maestro y se recuerda para el dispositivo. Solo afecta a lo que reproduce este widget; el volumen por dispositivo en los ajustes de sonido del sistema es una capa aparte e intacta — por eso esos números difieren de estos deslizadores."

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6509
msgctxt "compact: speaker plays the left channel"
msgid "L"
msgstr "L"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6510
msgctxt "compact: speaker plays the right channel"
msgid "R"
msgstr "R"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6511
msgctxt "compact: speaker plays a mono mix"
msgid "M"
msgstr "M"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6512
msgctxt "compact: speaker plays plain stereo"
msgid "ST"
msgstr "ST"

#: package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:6517
msgid "Which channels this speaker plays: stereo, left only, right only, or a mono mix of both. Set one speaker to L and another to R for a true stereo pair — remembered for the device."
msgstr "Qué canales reproduce este altavoz: estéreo, solo izquierdo, solo derecho o una mezcla mono de ambos. Pon un altavoz en L y otro en R para un verdadero par estéreo — se recuerda para el dispositivo."

